OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786636099
OL,3,CGap between North and London widens on
OL,4,CA-level results day
OL,6,FThe gap between the A-level entries
OL,7,Fgetting the top grades in the North of
OL,8,FEngland and London has increased since
OL,9,Flast year.
OL,11,FIn the North West, 26.5% of entires
OL,12,Fwere awarded an A or A*, down from
OL,13,F26.6% last year.
OL,15,FThis compares to 32.7% in London,
OL,16,Fwhich is the highest for any region in
OL,17,FEngland and up from 32.1% in 2025.
OL,19,FThe North East and the East Midlands
OL,20,Fhad the joint lowest rate, at 23.1%.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
