OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786636099
OL,3,CGap between North and London widens on
OL,4,CA-level results day
OL,6,FThe gap between London and each of
OL,7,Fthese two regions now stands at 9.6
OL,8,Fpercentage points, the largest since
OL,9,Fthe present system of grading began in
OL,10,F2010.
OL,12,FStudents on the Isle of Man have also
OL,13,Fbeen finding out their grades, where
OL,14,Foverall figures have not yet been
OL,15,Frevealed.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
