CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786636099
OL,3,CGap between North and London widens on
OL,4,CA-level results day
OL,6,FKeith Winstanley, the Headteacher of
OL,7,FCastle Rushen High School on the Isle
OL,8,Fof Man said: "The emotions today, like
OL,9,Fmost A-level results days that we've
OL,10,Fhad in the past, are overwhelming
OL,11,Fhappiness.
OL,13,F"The vast majority of youngsters have
OL,14,Fgot what they need and they're heading
OL,15,Fonto UK university, the traditional
OL,16,Fbookend to high school and A-levels in
OL,17,Fparticular, but not everyone goes that
OL,18,Froute anymore.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786636099
OL,3,CGap between North and London widens on
OL,4,CA-level results day
OL,6,F"Increasingly, we see youngsters who
OL,7,Fwant to take advantage of the world of
OL,8,Fwork here on the island."
OL,10,FHenri Murison, Chief Executive of the
OL,11,FNorthern Powerhouse Partnership, said:
OL,12,F"Congratulations to every college
OL,13,Fstudent and school leaver receiving
OL,14,Ftheir BTEC, T-Level and A Level
OL,15,Fresults across the North of England
OL,16,Ftoday.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786636099
OL,3,CGap between North and London widens on
OL,4,CA-level results day
OL,6,F"It is disappointing that every region
OL,7,Fof England for A-Level at A* and A is
OL,8,Fbelow the English average apart from
OL,9,FLondon and the South East, and the gap
OL,10,Fbetween all three northern regions and
OL,11,FLondon has widened since last year.
OL,13,F"That means young people in the North
OL,14,Fare still behind when it comes to
OL,15,Fsecuring the highest grades that open
OL,16,Fthe door to the most competitive
OL,17,Funiversity courses. The North is home
OL,18,Fto many of the country's leading
OL,19,Funiversities and we must all do more
OL,20,Fto open the door to those
OL,21,Fopportunities.'
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786636099
OL,3,CGap between North and London widens on
OL,4,CA-level results day
OL,6,FHe added: "As Lucy Powell begins her
OL,7,Ftime as Education Secretary, she
OL,8,Fbrings a longstanding commitment to
OL,9,Ftackling the inequalities that hold
OL,10,Fyoung people back.
OL,12,F"We know that persistent long-term
OL,13,Fdisadvantage is one of the biggest
OL,14,Fdrivers of these regional gaps, which
OL,15,Fis why we have argued for reform of
OL,16,Fthe Pupil Premium so that funding
OL,17,Freflects not simply whether a child
OL,18,Fhas experienced disadvantage, but how
OL,19,Flong they have lived with it.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
