PN,36207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786636099
OL,3,CGap between North and London widens on
OL,4,CA-level results day
OL,6,F"These results underline the urgent
OL,7,Fneed to make progress on that agenda."
OL,9,FWant more on the issues affecting the
OL,10,FNorth? Our podcast, From the North
OL,11,Fanswers the questions that matter to
OL,12,Four region.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/7
